# rk integrate runs this clone's pre-merge-commit hook through git, on the
# change the integration squashes, and refuses where none is installed.
# Tag pre-merge-commit on every check that must pass before work reaches
# the trunk, and add it to default_stages where this file sets them. Have
# continuous integration invoke the same checks: a check that runs on one
# side of the boundary alone guards one side alone. prek runs each nested
# .pre-commit-config.yaml as a project of its own, so a project that runs
# prek lists a directory of fixtures in a root .prekignore.
